    "preview_note": "AMAT enters Q3 at a steep ramp: Q2 record $7.91B, Q3 guide $8.95B +/- $0.5B implies ~13% sequential growth on AI logic/DRAM/HBM. Setup hinges on 1) shipment conversion vs supply-chain readiness flagged by CFO build-plan/inventory lift, 2) gross margin holding ~50% despite mix shift to systems, and 3) strategic investment gains normalizing. Beat/miss will be decided by foundry/logic pull-ins vs any China headwinds and working-capital drag on cash.",
